{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>demo</strong> version includes the first chapter of the game. In it you can get an overview of the basic gameplay and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game in which the author creatively manipulates the template of the main character. It invites players to assume the role of a mob cat within a whimsical atmosphere of various fairy tales. Even the characters, who lack individual names, are memorable due to their distinct personalities and roles in the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the course of the story, you will encounter puzzles of varying difficulty. The most intriguing aspect is that while solving these puzzles, you can truly engage with the world and its characters. Additionally, there are a few hidden secrets to discover. Although the game appears simple and straightforward, it manages to raise interesting questions about loneliness, trust and self-expression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Genre: point&amp;click, visual novel, mini-games, fantasy, fairy tale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 4 chapters + 1 secret chapter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Walkthrough: 1-2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Point&amp;Click with Classic Style!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648270/extras/setumei3_eng.jpg?t=1756492320\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Brain-teasing Puzzles!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648270/extras/1.jpg?t=1756492320\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Journey Between Fairy Tale and Reality!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648270/extras/3.jpg?t=1756492320\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translation from Japanese - Jan Ustavshi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30d5\u30ea\u30fcBGM DOVA-SYNDROME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u52b9\u679c\u97f3\u30e9\u30dc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30dd\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u30b5\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9 \u2013 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On-Jin \uff5e\u97f3\u4eba\uff5e\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7a7a\u60f3\u66f2\u7dda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3055\u304f\u305f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648270?t=1756492320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648270/cdc066094495d565c4cac61240e65c238cb01a23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756492320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648270/483544f83b556e8fbbe6e1b8105f73802e7a6e97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756492320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648270/483544f83b556e8fbbe6e1b8105f73802e7a6e97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756492320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>demo</strong> version includes the first chapter of the game. In it you can get an overview of the basic gameplay and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\